        "title": "Black Unicorn Records",
        "meta_descr": "Black Unicorn Records. Home to F.L.F. *friends, Lovers & Family, Quietman, Larry Lush is an independent label dedicated to music that matters — authentic, genre-defying, and artist-first.\nWe champion musicians who refuse to fit the mold, building fairer pathways outside the streaming system.\nFrom raw recordings to real-world performances, we believe in bringing back the soul of sound — one artist, one listener, one record at a time.",
